'''Snow Cloak''' is a [[buff]], cast by [[They of Tul]] for its [[Ally|allie]]s.

When They of Tul is raised as a spectre via the {{il|Raise Spectre}} [[active skill gem|skill gem]], or converted temporarily via {{il|Conversion Trap}}, the player character and other allies gain additional chance to avoid damage from hits while in the [[area of effect]] of Snow Cloak.

The buff effect of monster version of this skill scales with the monster level of They of Tul, which is capped at a maximum level of 68. (i.e., a lvl. 80 monster level They of Tul has the same max Snow Cloak skill as lvl. 68.) The monster version also granted reduced damage taken to the monster's allies.

The internal id of the monster skill is "BreachBlizzard". The id of spectred version is [[Skill:BreachBlizzardSpectre|BreachBlizzardSpectre]].

[[Tul, Creeping Avalanche]] uses an enhanced version of the skill (id: [[Skill:BreachBlizzardBoss|BreachBlizzardBoss]]) which applies the buff to herself and her minions.

